text = "
The goal of this game is to gain the highest score possible in one 1 run. You control 2 characters: the kangaroo and the bird. In a run you gain a score every second. If the kangaroo hits the kangaroo coloured obstacle or if the bird hits the bird coloured obstacle then you gain an extra +5 score. If the opposite happens the run ends. 

W and S for bird vertical movement and Up arrow and Down arrow for Kangaroo vertical movement.
"
